# U-Boot environment for MOCHAbin (Marvell Armada 7040)
# Used by fw_printenv/fw_setenv from u-boot-tools package
#
# Format: Device Offset Size [SectorSize] [DevOffset]
#
# MOCHAbin stores U-Boot environment in SPI NOR flash:
# - Environment offset: 0x3F0000 (just before U-Boot image)
# - Environment size: 64KB (0x10000)
# - Sector size: 64KB (0x10000) - SPI NOR typical
#
# For Tow-Boot: Environment may be at different offset
# Check with: cat /proc/mtd
#
# Standard Marvell U-Boot layout:
/dev/mtd0       0x3F0000        0x10000         0x10000

# Alternative: If using block device access (some newer kernels)
# /dev/mtdblock0  0x3F0000        0x10000
